{"availability":"available","full":"Tahmudun/groupchat-analytics-engine","name":"groupchat-analytics-engine","description":"Group-chat analytics engine in TypeScript + PostgreSQL: Instagram export ingestion, identity reconciliation, multi-provider LLM sentiment, daily member scoring, and a Netflix-themed Next.js site. Live demo runs on a synthetic chat.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T00:49:48Z","updated":"2026-10-04T13:41:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://groupchat-wrapped-demo.vercel.app","topics":["analytics","data-engineering","etl","identity-resolution","llm","nextjs","postgresql","sentiment-analysis","synthetic-data","typescript"],"demo":"https://groupchat-wrapped-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:49.575Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:49.575Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:49.575Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:49.575Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A data pipeline and analytics site for group-chat exports, presented as a streaming service. Members are \"shows\", messages are \"episodes\", and a nightly pipeline turns a raw Instagram export into daily member scores, a stock-market-style chart, Netflix-style category rows and a Spotify-Wrapped-style recap for each person.","Live demo: groupchat-wrapped-demo.vercel.app. It's a fully fictional chat, generated by this repo and analyzed by the same pipeline.","The original runs privately on a real friend group's chat: about 1M messages, 0.9M reactions and 860 senders over about six and a half months. Every name and message in this repo, its screenshots and the demo comes from a synthetic chat (below). The only facts from the real chat are aggregate pipeline metrics (sizes, run times, counts), and no real conversation data is published."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/T